---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="方法论">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6" data-i18n="methodology.title">算法与方法论</h1>

  <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.data_sources">数据来源</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2" data-i18n="methodology.data_sources_desc">IMS Games 从多个透明来源聚合评论：</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li data-i18n="methodology.ds.kaggle"><strong>Metacritic Kaggle 数据集</strong> — 12,000+ 款游戏的历史媒体评分</li>
        <li data-i18n="methodology.ds.opencritic"><strong>OpenCritic</strong> — API 或模拟数据，提供含媒体信息的独立评论</li>
        <li data-i18n="methodology.ds.future">未来来源：Steam 评论、IGDB、中文游戏媒体、视频评论者</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.normalization">分数标准化</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.normalization_desc">所有分数均通过文档化规则转换为统一的 0–100 量表：</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-sm">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>8/10</strong> &rarr; 80</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>4/5</strong> &rarr; 80</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>85/100</strong> &rarr; 85</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>A</strong> &rarr; 90</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>A-</strong> &rarr; 87</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>B+</strong> &rarr; 83</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>B</strong> &rarr; 80</div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><strong>C</strong> &rarr; 70</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-3" data-i18n="methodology.normalization_note">非数字评分（如"推荐"）不计入数字平均值。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.score_types">分数类型</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-400 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800" data-i18n="methodology.score.raw">IMS 原始分</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm" data-i18n="methodology.score.raw_desc">所有有效标准化评分的简单平均值。<code>mean(normalized_score)</code></p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-400 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800" data-i18n="methodology.score.median">IMS 中位数分</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm" data-i18n="methodology.score.median_desc">所有标准化分数的中位数。对异常值敏感度较低。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-400 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800" data-i18n="methodology.score.robust">IMS 稳健分</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm" data-i18n="methodology.score.robust_desc">截尾均值：去除最高 5% 和最低 5% 的分数后取平均（需 &ge;20 条评论）。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-purple-400 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800" data-i18n="methodology.score.calibrated">IMS 校准分</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm" data-i18n="methodology.score.calibrated_desc">
            根据每个来源的历史评分倾向进行调整。一贯高分的来源会被向下调整；严格的来源会被向上调整。使用 z-score 校准：
            <code>calibrated = global_mean + z * global_std</code>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-ims-500 pl-4">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800" data-i18n="methodology.score.weighted">IMS 加权分</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm" data-i18n="methodology.score.weighted_desc">
            使用透明来源权重的加权平均。权重考虑样本量、
            区分度、类型/平台相关性以及信息披露完整度。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.weight_formula">媒体权重公式</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.weight_formula_desc">每个来源的权重计算如下：</p>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-sm mb-3">
        context_weight = base_weight &times; sample_confidence &times; discrimination_factor
        &times; genre_relevance &times; platform_relevance &times; disclosure_factor
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
          <thead class="bg-gray-50"><tr>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-medium" data-i18n="methodology.weight.component">组件</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-medium" data-i18n="methodology.weight.range">范围</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-medium" data-i18n="methodology.weight.description">描述</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-t">
              <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">base_weight</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2">1.0</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.weight.base_weight">所有来源的起始权重</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t">
              <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">sample_confidence</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2">0.6–1.1</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.weight.sample_confidence">历史评论越多，置信度越高</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t">
              <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">discrimination_factor</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2">0.7–1.1</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.weight.discrimination_factor">评分方差越大的来源权重越高</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t">
              <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">genre_relevance</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2">0.8–1.2</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.weight.genre_relevance">该游戏类型的评论越多，相关性越高</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t">
              <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">platform_relevance</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2">0.8–1.1</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.weight.platform_relevance">该游戏平台的评论越多，相关性越高</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-t">
              <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">disclosure_factor</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2">0.9–1.05</td>
              <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.weight.disclosure_factor">评测码/赞助披露略微提升权重</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.external_baseline">外部基准 vs IMS 评分</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600" data-i18n="methodology.external_baseline_desc">
        Metacritic 和 OpenCritic 分数仅作为<strong>外部基准参考</strong>显示。
        它们不会混入 IMS 算法分数。页面明确区分了
        外部参考分数和 IMS 透明分数。
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" data-i18n="methodology.limitations">已知局限（v0.1）</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li data-i18n="methodology.limit.genre_platform">许多老游戏的类型和平台数据不完整</li>
        <li data-i18n="methodology.limit.letter_grade">字母等级转换使用固定映射</li>
        <li data-i18n="methodology.limit.calibration">校准需要每个来源 &ge;10 条评论</li>
        <li data-i18n="methodology.limit.formulas">权重组件使用简化公式；未来版本可能使用更复杂的模型</li>
        <li data-i18n="methodology.limit.video_chinese">视频创作者和中文媒体尚未纳入</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
